2026-05-28 11:32:27,037 | DEBUG | anthropic._base_client | Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-a4238e8a-f3dd-439c-892d-812d7d4ec1b5', 'content': None, 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 8192, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': 'Requirement (natural language):\nImplement a producer-consumer system with three components:\n\n  1. A bounded FIFO queue of capacity 3. Items are positive integers in\n     1..10. Enqueue is rejected when the queue is full; dequeue is rejected\n     when the queue is empty.\n  2. A producer that generates items 1..3 in order and enqueues them.\n  3. A consumer that dequeues items and tracks the running sum.\n\nSafety properties:\n  - The queue length is always in 0..3.\n  - No item is ever lost: every item produced is eventually consumed in\n    FIFO order (i.e. consumer.received is a prefix of producer.generated).\n  - The producer never produces beyond item 3.\n\nApproved decomposition plan:\nParent: ProducerConsumerSystem\nParent role: Composes the bounded queue, producer, and consumer; producer enqueues into the queue, consumer dequeues from it, and the parent asserts FIFO no-loss and bounded-length invariants across the composed state.\n\nChild modules:\n  - BoundedQueue: A bounded FIFO buffer of capacity 3 holding integers in 1..10, with rejection on full/empty.\n      state_variables: buffer\n      actions: Enqueue, Dequeue\n      invariant_sketch: Buffer length is always between 0 and 3, and every element is in 1..10.\n  - Producer: Generates items 1, 2, 3 in order and offers them to the queue.\n      state_variables: generated, nextItem\n      actions: Produce\n      invariant_sketch: generated is a prefix of <<1,2,3>> and nextItem never exceeds 4.\n  - Consumer: Consumes items from the queue and maintains a running sum and received history.\n      state_variables: received, sum\n      actions: Consume\n      invariant_sketch: sum equals the total of received, and received contains only items in 1..10 in the order they were dequeued.\n\nExpand this plan into a ModuleBundle. For each child, emit both <Name>_Abs (pure TLA+) and <Name>_Impl (PlusCal-bearing TLA+). Emit a parent module that INSTANCEs each impl and defines its own composed Inv and Property. Pin small finite CONSTANTS so TLC can model-check exhaustively. Emit one call to propose_module_bundle.'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_011duuodpfFkRC93FZGNaZd6', 'name': 'propose_module_bundle', 'input': {'slug': 'producer_consumer_system', 'parent': {'name': 'ProducerConsumerSystem', 'invariant_name': 'Inv', 'property_name': 'Property', 'tla_source': '---- MODULE ProducerConsumerSystem ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\n\nVARIABLES buffer, generated, nextItem, received, sum, pcQ, pcP, pcC\n\nQ == INSTANCE BoundedQueue_Impl WITH buffer <- buffer, pc <- pcQ\nP == INSTANCE Producer_Impl WITH generated <- generated, nextItem <- nextItem, pc <- pcP\nC == INSTANCE Consumer_Impl WITH received <- received, sum <- sum, pc <- pcC\n\nSpec == Q!Spec /\\ P!Spec /\\ C!Spec\n\nIsPrefix(s, t) == Len(s) <= Len(t) /\\ \\A i \\in 1..Len(s) : s[i] = t[i]\n\nSumSeq(s) ==\n  LET RECURSIVE Sigma(_)\n      Sigma(k) == IF k = 0 THEN 0 ELSE s[k] + Sigma(k-1)\n  IN Sigma(Len(s))\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ Q!Inv\n  /\\ P!Inv\n  /\\ C!Inv\n  /\\ Len(buffer) \\in 0..3\n  /\\ IsPrefix(received, generated)\n  /\\ received \\o buffer = generated\n  /\\ sum = SumSeq(received)\n  /\\ nextItem \\in 1..4\n\nProperty ==\n  /\\ Len(buffer) \\in 0..3\n  /\\ IsPrefix(received, generated)\n  /\\ nextItem <= 4\n\n===='}, 'modules': [{'name': 'BoundedQueue', 'role': 'abs', 'invariant_name': 'Inv', 'property_name': 'Property', 'tla_source': "---- MODULE BoundedQueue_Abs ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\n\nCONSTANTS Capacity, MaxItem\n\nVARIABLE queue\n\nvars == <<queue>>\n\nInit == queue = <<>>\n\nEnqueue(x) ==\n  /\\ x \\in 1..MaxItem\n  /\\ Len(queue) < Capacity\n  /\\ queue' = Append(queue, x)\n\nDequeue ==\n  /\\ Len(queue) > 0\n  /\\ queue' = Tail(queue)\n\nNext == (\\E x \\in 1..MaxItem : Enqueue(x)) \\/ Dequeue\n\nSpec == Init /\\ [][Next]_vars\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ queue \\in Seq(1..MaxItem)\n  /\\ Len(queue) \\in 0..Capacity\n\nProperty == Len(queue) \\in 0..Capacity\n\n===="}, {'name': 'BoundedQueue', 'role': 'impl', 'invariant_name': 'Inv', 'property_name': 'Property', 'abstraction_map': {'queue': 'buffer'}, 'tla_source': '---- MODULE BoundedQueue_Impl ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\n\nCONSTANTS Capacity, MaxItem\n\n(* --algorithm BoundedQueue\nvariables buffer = <<>>;\n\nbegin\nLoop:\n  while TRUE do\n    either\n      with x \\in 1..MaxItem do\n        if Len(buffer) < Capacity then\n          buffer := Append(buffer, x);\n        end if;\n      end with;\n    or\n      if Len(buffer) > 0 then\n        buffer := Tail(buffer);\n      end if;\n    end either;\n  end while;\nend algorithm; *)\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ buffer \\in Seq(1..MaxItem)\n  /\\ Len(buffer) \\in 0..Capacity\n  /\\ pc \\in {"Loop", "Done"}\n\nProperty == Len(buffer) \\in 0..Capacity\n\n====', 'pluscal_source': '---- MODULE BoundedQueue_Impl ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\n\nCONSTANTS Capacity, MaxItem\n\n(* --algorithm BoundedQueue\nvariables buffer = <<>>;\n\nbegin\nLoop:\n  while TRUE do\n    either\n      with x \\in 1..MaxItem do\n        if Len(buffer) < Capacity then\n          buffer := Append(buffer, x);\n        end if;\n      end with;\n    or\n      if Len(buffer) > 0 then\n        buffer := Tail(buffer);\n      end if;\n    end either;\n  end while;\nend algorithm; *)\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ buffer \\in Seq(1..MaxItem)\n  /\\ Len(buffer) \\in 0..Capacity\n  /\\ pc \\in {"Loop", "Done"}\n\nProperty == Len(buffer) \\in 0..Capacity\n\n====', 'constants': {'values': {'Capacity': [3], 'MaxItem': [10]}}}, {'name': 'Producer', 'role': 'abs', 'invariant_name': 'Inv', 'property_name': 'Property', 'tla_source': "---- MODULE Producer_Abs ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\n\nCONSTANTS MaxProduce\n\nVARIABLES generated, nextItem\n\nvars == <<generated, nextItem>>\n\nTargetSeq == [i \\in 1..MaxProduce |-> i]\n\nInit ==\n  /\\ generated = <<>>\n  /\\ nextItem = 1\n\nProduce ==\n  /\\ nextItem <= MaxProduce\n  /\\ generated' = Append(generated, nextItem)\n  /\\ nextItem' = nextItem + 1\n\nNext == Produce\n\nSpec == Init /\\ [][Next]_vars\n\nIsPrefix(s, t) == Len(s) <= Len(t) /\\ \\A i \\in 1..Len(s) : s[i] = t[i]\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ nextItem \\in 1..(MaxProduce+1)\n  /\\ Len(generated) = nextItem - 1\n  /\\ IsPrefix(generated, TargetSeq)\n\nProperty == nextItem <= MaxProduce + 1\n\n===="}, {'name': 'Producer', 'role': 'impl', 'invariant_name': 'Inv', 'property_name': 'Property', 'abstraction_map': {'generated': 'generated', 'nextItem': 'nextItem'}, 'tla_source': '---- MODULE Producer_Impl ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\n\nCONSTANTS MaxProduce\n\n(* --algorithm Producer\nvariables generated = <<>>, nextItem = 1;\n\nbegin\nLoop:\n  while nextItem <= MaxProduce do\n    generated := Append(generated, nextItem);\n    nextItem := nextItem + 1;\n  end while;\nFinish:\n  skip;\nend algorithm; *)\n\nIsPrefix(s, t) == Len(s) <= Len(t) /\\ \\A i \\in 1..Len(s) : s[i] = t[i]\n\nTargetSeq == [i \\in 1..MaxProduce |-> i]\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ nextItem \\in 1..(MaxProduce+1)\n  /\\ Len(generated) = nextItem - 1\n  /\\ IsPrefix(generated, TargetSeq)\n  /\\ pc \\in {"Loop", "Finish", "Done"}\n  /\\ (pc \\in {"Finish", "Done"}) => (nextItem = MaxProduce + 1)\n\nProperty == nextItem <= MaxProduce + 1\n\n====', 'pluscal_source': '---- MODULE Producer_Impl ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\n\nCONSTANTS MaxProduce\n\n(* --algorithm Producer\nvariables generated = <<>>, nextItem = 1;\n\nbegin\nLoop:\n  while nextItem <= MaxProduce do\n    generated := Append(generated, nextItem);\n    nextItem := nextItem + 1;\n  end while;\nFinish:\n  skip;\nend algorithm; *)\n\nIsPrefix(s, t) == Len(s) <= Len(t) /\\ \\A i \\in 1..Len(s) : s[i] = t[i]\n\nTargetSeq == [i \\in 1..MaxProduce |-> i]\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ nextItem \\in 1..(MaxProduce+1)\n  /\\ Len(generated) = nextItem - 1\n  /\\ IsPrefix(generated, TargetSeq)\n  /\\ pc \\in {"Loop", "Finish", "Done"}\n  /\\ (pc \\in {"Finish", "Done"}) => (nextItem = MaxProduce + 1)\n\nProperty == nextItem <= MaxProduce + 1\n\n====', 'constants': {'values': {'MaxProduce': [3]}}}, {'name': 'Consumer', 'role': 'abs', 'invariant_name': 'Inv', 'property_name': 'Property', 'tla_source': "---- MODULE Consumer_Abs ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\n\nCONSTANTS MaxItem\n\nVARIABLES received, sum\n\nvars == <<received, sum>>\n\nSumSeq(s) ==\n  LET RECURSIVE Sigma(_)\n      Sigma(k) == IF k = 0 THEN 0 ELSE s[k] + Sigma(k-1)\n  IN Sigma(Len(s))\n\nInit ==\n  /\\ received = <<>>\n  /\\ sum = 0\n\nConsume(x) ==\n  /\\ x \\in 1..MaxItem\n  /\\ received' = Append(received, x)\n  /\\ sum' = sum + x\n\nNext == \\E x \\in 1..MaxItem : Consume(x)\n\nSpec == Init /\\ [][Next]_vars\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ received \\in Seq(1..MaxItem)\n  /\\ sum = SumSeq(received)\n\nProperty == sum = SumSeq(received)\n\n===="}, {'name': 'Consumer', 'role': 'impl', 'invariant_name': 'Inv', 'property_name': 'Property', 'abstraction_map': {'received': 'received', 'sum': 'sum'}, 'tla_source': '---- MODULE Consumer_Impl ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\n\nCONSTANTS MaxItem\n\n(* --algorithm Consumer\nvariables received = <<>>, sum = 0;\n\nbegin\nLoop:\n  while TRUE do\n    with x \\in 1..MaxItem do\n      received := Append(received, x);\n      sum := sum + x;\n    end with;\n  end while;\nend algorithm; *)\n\nSumSeq(s) ==\n  LET RECURSIVE Sigma(_)\n      Sigma(k) == IF k = 0 THEN 0 ELSE s[k] + Sigma(k-1)\n  IN Sigma(Len(s))\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ received \\in Seq(1..MaxItem)\n  /\\ sum = SumSeq(received)\n  /\\ pc \\in {"Loop", "Done"}\n\nProperty == sum = SumSeq(received)\n\n====', 'pluscal_source': '---- MODULE Consumer_Impl ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, Sequences\